your ultimate, anabolic rest and recovery support."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Continuously refuel your muscles with this powerful combination of slow-digesting micellar casein and fast-absorbing whey protein isolate throughout the day. Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60(TM) Casein is GNC’s premium sustained muscle fuel with over 17 grams BCAA, including 10 grams Leucine, plus 12 grams Glutamine, 500mg Carnitine and clinically studied ingredients to: \n- Improve muscle recovery with continuous anabolic fuel\n- Increase muscle strength and size by 30%\n- Promote muscle growth & strength\n- Enhance protein breakdown with advanced digestive enzymes"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Multi-Phase Protein Supplies Continuous Fuel for Muscle Recovery\nThis powerful combination or slow-digesting micellar casein and fast-absorbing whey protein isolate delivers amino acids throughout the day, providing you the ultimate muscle recovery."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"For continuous muscle support, simply take one scoop every 7-8 hours, three times daily."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"{Chart}\nMicellar Casein\nWhey Isolate\n24 hour\nEstimated duration of amino acid delivery over 24 hours"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"10 grams Leucine Blend clinically proven to increase post-exercise anabolic response\n10 grams Whey Protein Isolate\n10 grams Leucine\nIncreases insulin by 400% to support muscle building and recovery\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"In a randomized, double-blind, cross-over clinical trial that included 20 recreationally trained healthy male subjects, those taking a WPI and leucine blend immediately post-workout showed significant increases in plasma insulin concentration. Those taking the WPI and leucine blend showed 400% more insulin 30 minutes post-workout compared to a placebo.\n"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Gf\nGluten Free"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Nitro-Factor(TM) - Maximizing Muscle Building\nThe full muscle-building potential of a GNC product is based on its total nitrogen content - so the more nitrogen a product has, the stronger it will perform. Nitrogen needs increase during training, and if nitrogen levels are low, your body pulls from muscle stores, which can result in catabolism, poor performance and longer recovery. Pro Performance(R) AMP Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60(TM) Casein with a Nitro-Factor(TM) of 64 grams helps fuel performance and anabolism."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60(TM) Casein features 6 products in 1!\n1. Whey Protein Isolate\n2. Micellar Casein\n3. Leucine\n4. Carnitine\n5. Theanine\n6. Digestive Enzymes"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"6 products in one"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"- 40 grams slow-digesting Micellar Casein + 20 grams rapid-absorbing Whey Isolate for sustained muscle fuel & recovery\n- Clinically proven Protein Blend to help rebuild & repair muscles\n- 17 grams BCAA, 10 grams Leucine & 12 grams Glutamine to combat muscle breakdown\n- Advanced Enzymes for enhanced digestion"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Banned Substance Free"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Nitro-Factor 64 grams(TM)"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Clinically Researched"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Natural + Artificial flavors"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"AMP"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 414748 JPG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, consume 1-3 scoops of GNC Pro Performance(R) AMP Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60(TM) Casein in 4-6 fl oz cold water per scoop post-workout. For continuous support and maximum results, take 1 full scoop every 7-8 hours, three times daily.\nDaily Dose Total Protein Benefit\n1 scoop in the morning 20 grams Helps meet protein need & fuels metabolism\n1 scoop in the afternoon, 7-8 hours after previous dose 40 grams Fuels muscles & metabolism, supports recovery & muscle protein synthesis\n1 scoop in the evening, 7-8 hours after previous dose 60 grams Increases muscle size, anabolic factors, and strength by 30%"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains: Milk and Soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Milk and Soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Notice: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Typical Amino Acid Profile Per 3 Scoop Serving\nAlanine 1965 mg\nArginine 2430 mg\nAspartate 5470 mg\nCystine 815 mg\nGlutamine/Glutamic Acid 12350 mg\nGlycine 1130 mg\nHistidine 1405 mg\nIsoleucine 3560 mg\nLeucine 10550 mg\nLysine 5420 mg\nMethionine 1625 mg\nPhenylalanine 2635 mg\nProline 5500 mg\nSerine 3170 mg\nThreonine 3255 mg\nTryptophan 974 mg\nTyrosine 2780 mg\nValine 3575 mg\nTotal 68609 mg\nIndicates Branched Chain Amino Acids (BCAA).\nDenotes naturally occurring and added free form amino acids.\n"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Stack with: Pro Perfromance(R) AMP Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60(TM), Strength Vitapak(R) Program and N.O. Loaded(TM) V2."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Informed-Choice {check}.org\nTrusted by sport"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Products bearing this logo have been tested for banned substances by LGC Sport Science, a world-class anti-doping lab. \nProduct was tested for over 145 banned substances on the 2015 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) prohibited List via LGC skip lot testing protocol #ICP0307. See gnc.com for more information."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"In a randomized, double-blind controlled study of sixteen health adults, subjects consumed either whey protein or casein containing equal amounts of leucine. While plasma branched chain amino acid levels were highest at 100 minutes post-supplementation in subjects who consumed whey protein, after 300 minuted BCAA levels were higher in subjects who consumed casein compared to those who took whey protein.\nWhen combined with a resistance training program.\nAn 8-week study of athletes performing an intense resistance exercise training regimen demonstrated that those using the proprietary module of whey protein and leucine had greater increases in muscle strength and size than those on a placebo.\nPer 3 scoop serving"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Aminogen(R) & Carbogen(R) are registered trademarks of Triarco Industries. \nEnzyme Matrix(TM) are products of National Enzyme Company. \nEnzyme Matrix is a GNC trademark. \nCereCalase(R) is a registered trademark of National Enzyme Company. \nSuntheanine(R) is a registered trademark of Taiyo International, Inc. \nLactium(R) is a registered trademark of Ingredia and used under license."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2015-07-24","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years an